message:
Find Your Wedding Photography Style

Wedding photographers tend toward a style:
• light and airy;
• dark and moody;
• classic and timeless;
• documentary.

None is better, but you'll live with it forever, so pick the one you genuinely love. Ask to see two or three complete weddings, not just a highlight reel, to check they're consistent.

